        "text": "<p>Dr. Sam is a second generation, board-certified acupuncturist and clinical herbalist from Boston, MA. He also specializes in Japanese palpation-based diagnosis and musculoskeletal trigger point therapy.</p><p>He has a passion for natural approaches to restore health and achieve optimum function of the body, mind and spirit using Chinese herbal medicine, nutrition, lifestyle and supplementation. He focuses on nervous system health, sports medicine, pain management and autoimmune conditions.</p>",
