        "roles": "Women's health, hormonal balance, fertility support",
        "lead": "",
        "text": "<p>Caroline Kirk is a licensed acupuncturist and herbalist. Her path into Chinese medicine was shaped by her own healing journey, after years of chronic migraines and recurring back and neck pain, she experienced firsthand the transformative impact of acupuncture and herbal medicine.</p><p>Rooted in Chinese medicine and informed by a modern understanding of physiology, Caroline takes an individualized approach, looking beyond symptoms to uncover the deeper patterns driving imbalance. She frequently supports patients with concerns such as irregular cycles, PCOS, fertility support, post–birth control transitions, and stress-related hormonal disruptions.</p>",
        "quote": "Hormonal Imbalance · Menstrual Irregularity · Mental Health · Fertility Support · Pain Management · Digestive Disorders · Cosmetic Acupuncture",
