        "text": "<p>Dr. Sarah Viducic is a board-certified acupuncturist and clinical herbalist known for her precise, results-driven approach and ability to quickly identify underlying patterns in the body. Her integrative style blends Traditional Chinese Medicine with modern, clinical strategy. She believes effective healing begins with deeply listening, to both the patient and the body, allowing her to create highly targeted, individualized treatment plans.</p><p>She specializes in sports medicine, hormonal health, fertility and ART support, pain management, and nervous system regulation, supporting patients experiencing stress, anxiety, and burnout. Her treatments are multi-modal in order to create measurable, lasting change.</p>",
